IV. DATASET
A. Our SG-LSTM Dataset and Data Annotation
Our dataset (Fig. 4) is based on data collected on the Purdue Campus at West Lafayette and publicly available 3D point cloud, and RGB-D pedestrian dataset [42]. In this study, we manually annotated perceptually-visible pedestrian groups in crowded scenes from RGB frames. We utilized a reference algorithm to aid in labeling, which
